<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Elonsreveswork — Executive Digital Presence</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Executive-grade digital presence for a modern business brand. Elonsreveswork: leadership, credibility, strategic value.">
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#ffffff;--muted:#556084;--accent:#0b3b66;--panel:#f7f9fb;--max:1100px}
    body{font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;line-height:1.6;color:var(--accent);margin:0;background:var(--bg)}
    .container{max-width:var(--max);margin:48px auto;padding:28px}
    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:12px 0}
    .brand{font-weight:700;font-size:20px;color:var(--accent)}
    .tag{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px;padding:36px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff,#fbfdff);box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(11,59,102,0.06)}
    h1{margin:0;font-size:32px;line-height:1.05;color:var(--accent)}
    p.lead{margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:16px}
    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:18px;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    section{margin-top:28px}
    h2{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:10px;color:var(--accent)}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:16px}
    .card{background:var(--panel);padding:18px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(11,59,102,0.04)}
    footer{margin:48px 0 24px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;text-align:center}
    @media (max-width:640px){.container{margin:20px;padding:16px}.hero{padding:20px}h1{font-size:24px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <div>
        <div class="brand">Elonsreveswork</div>
        <div class="tag">Executive-grade digital presence</div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="primary">
        <a href="#about" style="color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px">About</a>
        <a href="#services" style="color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px">Services</a>
        <a href="#contact" style="color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="hero" role="main">
      <div>
        <h1>Executive-grade digital presence for a modern business brand</h1>
        <p class="lead">Elonsreveswork is crafted to communicate leadership, credibility, and strategic value. A clean, efficient, and premium digital presence optimized for swift deployment and confident engagement.</p>
        <a class="cta" href="#contact">Request a Consultation</a>
      </div>
    </main>

    <section id="about">
      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p>Elonsreveswork is a contemporary corporate website that reflects the standards of modern executive brands. It projects confidence and professionalism while remaining flexible and easy to maintain.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="services">
      <h2>Core Capabilities</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">Strategic Positioning</h3>
          <p style="margin:0;color:var(--muted)">Clear, compelling messaging that highlights leadership, expertise, and market differentiation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">Executive Communications</h3>
          <p style="margin:0;color:var(--muted)">Concise narratives for stakeholders, investors, and clients—crafted for clarity and impact.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">Case Studies & Trust Signals</h3>
          <p style="margin:0;color:var(--muted)">Selected projects, client results, and endorsements that demonstrate measurable outcomes.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="approach">
      <h2>Design & Experience</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--muted)">Minimal, refined visual systems—premium typography, restrained palettes, and considered layouts that communicate authority without excess.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--muted)">For executive inquiries, partnerships, or consultations, please reach out:</p>
      <p style="margin-top:8px"><a href="mailto:hello@example.com" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">hello@example.com</a></p>
    </section>

    <footer>
      © Elonsreveswork — Executive Digital Presence
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
